pawns. Only the long sword in hand can cut through the illusions.<strong>Eternal Dragon Usurper:</strong> Is the flesh weak? Then dismantle the bones to forge armor! Is fate immutable? Then burn the heavens and change destiny! Complete the forbidden ritual, ascend as emperor, and use secret arts to control the major factions and court officials\u2014so that strife may cease forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863760/extras/b8c4365aca66fcfcfc75c134cd09db7b.poster.avif?t=1769158693\" width=700 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863760/extras/b8c4365aca66fcfcfc75c134cd09db7b.webm?t=1769158693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863760/extras/b8c4365aca66fcfcfc75c134cd09db7b.mp4?t=1769158693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Countless Arts, Limitless Builds\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four sets of weapon skills (more to come), hundreds of divine arms, thousands of inscription combinations, paired with a variety of unique martial arts and internal techniques for free build construction. Rich Roguelite elements ensure endless fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch freely between different build combinations without starting over. Challenge all levels freely; different builds will offer unique experiences against different bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863760/extras/c4f71bd0f1ca984d14299609fd5dffbc.poster.avif?t=1769158693\" width=700 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863760/extras/c4f71